### =============================================================================
### Antigravity Node.js - Localhost Command Center & API Testing
### =============================================================================
### Click "Send Request" above any block to execute against your localhost server.
### =============================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000

### 1. Health Check & Primary Mongo Cluster Latency
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### 2. Measure Round-Trip Latency to Any Tenant Database
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/ping/prod_jobiak_ai

### 3. List All Configured Multi-Tenant Clients
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/clients

### 4. GPD Quality Audit (Checks leading timestamps, stray dots, schema readiness)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/run/gpd/audit
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "client": "YES! Communities",
  "limit": 100
}

### 5. GPD Description Sanitizer (Dry-run: commit=false)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/run/gpd/clean
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "client": "YES! Communities",
  "commit": false
}

### 6. Interactive Schema Cleaning & Google for Jobs Compliance Test
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/schema/validate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Grounds Keeper / Maintenance Tech",
  "description": "Posted Wednesday, August 26, 2026, 4:00 AM <p><strong>.</strong></p><p>We are seeking a dedicated Grounds Keeper. Visit yescommunities.com/careers directly for confirmed position openings.</p>8401 E Saddlebrook Dr, Charleston SC"
}

### 7. GXC Feed Operations - List All Syndication Collections
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/gxc/collections

### 8. GXC Feed Intelligence - Cross-Feed Comparison (DoorDash, Uber, etc.)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/run/gxc/compare
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "company": "doordash|uber"
}

### 9. Daily Cluster Stats (Active vs Inactive vs Total Inventory)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/run/stats/daily

### 10. Clicks & Telemetry Report (Past 7 Days)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/run/stats/clicks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "days": 7
}

### 11. WhatJobs Revenue & Inventory Sync
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/run/revenue/whatjobs

### 12. Trigger Feed Reconciliation (Staging Target_P4_Opt vs Production Posted)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/feed/summary

### 13. Trigger Full Daily Proxy Pipeline (Updates -> Expires)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/run/pipeline


### 14. Duplicate Job Clustering & Cannibalization Prevention (Concentrix)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/run/dedup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "client": "Concentrix",
  "limit": 500
}

### 15. Googlebot Crawl vs View Bottleneck Analyzer (HCSG)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/run/audit/indexing
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "client": "HCSG",
  "limit": 100
}

### 16. Location Keywords Expansion (HCSG)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/run/keywords/expand
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "client": "HCSG",
  "limit": 50
}
